      "type": "technical",
      "question": "Spark 分区器有哪些",
      "topic": [
        "spark",
        "partitioner"
      ],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "frequency": "medium",
      "source_type": "ai_generated",
      "sources": [
        {
          "interview_id": "INTERVIEW-2026-03-10-bytedance-data-intern-1",
          "company": "字节跳动",
          "position": "数据开发（实习，一面）",
          "date": "2026-03-10"
        }
      ],
      "domain": "spark",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "一句话",
          "html": "<p>主要有 HashPartitioner（按 key 哈希）和 RangePartitioner（按 key 范围），也可自定义。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "pitch",
          "stage_label": "一句话"
        },
        {
          "title": "30 秒回答",
          "html": "<p>HashPartitioner 用 key.hashCode 取模分到各分区；RangePartitioner 先采样确定边界，再按 key 范围分区，保证全局有序。sortByKey 用 Range，reduceByKey/groupByKey 用 Hash。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "short",
          "stage_label": "30 秒回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "1 分钟回答",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>HashPartitioner：默认，hash 取模，key 相同同分区，但易热点倾斜</li>\n<li>RangePartitioner：采样定边界，数据按范围分布，配合排序</li>\n<li>自定义 Partitioner：按业务 key 控制分区，常用于减少倾斜、数据局部性</li>\n<li>触发场景：宽依赖算子（reduceByKey/groupByKey/join）</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "long",
          "stage_label": "1 分钟回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "追问",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>HashPartitioner 为什么会倾斜？</li>\n<li>什么时候需要自定义分区器？</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "followup",
          "stage_label": "追问"
        }
      ],
