      "id": "SPARK-0093",
      "type": "technical",
      "question": "什么是RDD的宽依赖和窄依赖？",
      "topic": [
        "spark"
      ],
      "difficulty": 1,
      "frequency": "low",
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "domain": "spark",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "一句话",
          "html": "<p>窄依赖无 shuffle，宽依赖要 shuffle。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "pitch",
          "stage_label": "一句话"
        },
        {
          "title": "参考回答",
          "html": "<p>窄依赖每个子分区只依赖一个父分区，像 map、filter；宽依赖一个子分区依赖多个父分区，像 join、groupByKey，必须 shuffle。宽依赖是 Stage 划分的依据。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "long",
          "stage_label": "1 分钟回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "追问",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>宽依赖和 Stage 的关系？</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "followup",
          "stage_label": "追问"
        }
      ],
