      "id": "SPARK-0345",
      "type": "technical",
      "question": "Hadoop MR、Spark、Flink Job 提交流程对比？三者本质差异？（高频⭐⭐⭐⭐）",
      "difficulty": 0,
      "topic": [],
      "source_type": "knowledge",
