      "id": "SPARK-0369",
      "type": "technical",
      "question": "Spark 中的不同持久化级别？",
      "difficulty": 0,
      "topic": [],
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "frequency": "",
      "domain": "spark",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li><code>MEMORY_ONLY</code>：内存中存储反序列化对象（默认）</li>\n<li><code>MEMORY_AND_DISK</code>：内存不足时写入磁盘</li>\n<li><code>MEMORY_ONLY_SER</code>：内存中存储序列化对象（节省空间）</li>\n<li><code>MEMORY_AND_DISK_SER</code>：序列化 + 磁盘溢出</li>\n<li><code>DISK_ONLY</code>：仅磁盘存储</li>\n<li><code>OFF_HEAP</code>：堆外内存存储</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "notes",
          "stage_label": "补充说明"
        }
      ],
