      "id": "SPARK-0384",
      "type": "technical",
      "question": "AQE — 自适应查询执行",
      "difficulty": 0,
      "topic": [],
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "frequency": "",
      "domain": "spark",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "",
          "html": "<p>AQE 是 Spark 3.0 引入的核心优化特性，根据运行时真实数据统计信息动态调整执行计划。Spark 3.2+ 默认开启。</p>\n<p><strong>三大核心能力</strong>：</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>能力</th><th>说明</th><th>关键参数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>动态合并 Shuffle 分区</td><td>自动合并过小分区</td><td><code>advisoryPartitionSizeInBytes = 64m</code></td></tr><tr><td>动态切换 Join 策略</td><td>运行时数据量小则自动 Broadcast</td><td><code>autoBroadcastJoinThreshold = 10m</code></td></tr><tr><td>优化数据倾斜 Join</td><td>自动拆分倾斜分区</td><td><code>skewJoin.enabled = true</code></td></tr></tbody></table>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "notes",
          "stage_label": "补充说明"
        }
      ],
      "answer_outline": [
        "先给结论：用一句话讲清 mechanism / 结论",
        "展开机制：用 30 秒讲 2-3 个关键点，不堆名词",
        "补边界与落地：参数、取舍、异常、项目场景",
        "准备追问：回到原理、失败场景与优化空间"
      ],
