      "id": "FLINK-0018",
      "type": "technical",
      "question": "Checkpoint 重启能精准回溯到某一秒吗",
      "topic": [
        "flink",
        "checkpoint"
      ],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "frequency": "medium",
      "source_type": "ai_generated",
      "sources": [
        {
          "interview_id": "INTERVIEW-2026-06-23-tencent-kuaishou-zhenti",
          "company": "腾讯 / 快手",
          "position": "数据开发（一面真题）",
          "date": "2026-06-23"
        }
      ],
      "domain": "flink",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "一句话",
          "html": "<p>不能。Checkpoint 保存的是 barrier 对齐时的状态和位点，粒度是「事件位点」而非时间戳，只能回溯到最近一次成功的 Checkpoint 位点。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "pitch",
          "stage_label": "一句话"
        },
        {
          "title": "30 秒回答",
          "html": "<p>Checkpoint 记录的是算子状态 + source 位点（如 Kafka offset），是 barrier 对齐那一刻的一致性快照，不是按秒存的。重启从最近成功 Checkpoint 恢复位点，无法指定回溯到某个秒。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "short",
          "stage_label": "30 秒回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "1 分钟回答",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>barrier 对齐：所有并行度算子处理到 barrier 才做快照</li>\n<li>粒度：source 位点（offset/filename+position），不是时间戳</li>\n<li>恢复：从最近成功 Checkpoint 的位点精准重放</li>\n<li>想按时间回溯：要靠 savepoint 或业务侧记录时间 + 位点映射</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "long",
          "stage_label": "1 分钟回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "追问",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Checkpoint 和 savepoint 有什么区别？</li>\n<li>想按业务时间回溯怎么办？</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "followup",
          "stage_label": "追问"
        }
      ],
