      "id": "SQL-0028",
      "type": "technical",
      "question": "count(distinct) 的精度妥协优化",
      "topic": [
        "sql",
        "distinct"
      ],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "frequency": "medium",
      "source_type": "ai_generated",
      "sources": [
        {
          "interview_id": "INTERVIEW-2026-06-23-tencent-kuaishou-zhenti",
          "company": "腾讯 / 快手",
          "position": "数据开发（一面真题）",
          "date": "2026-06-23"
        }
      ],
      "domain": "sql",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "一句话",
          "html": "<p>数据量极大且可接受少量误差时，用 <code>approx_count_distinct</code>（基于 HyperLogLog）做近似去重，内存和时间远低于精确 count(distinct)。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "pitch",
          "stage_label": "一句话"
        },
        {
          "title": "30 秒回答",
          "html": "<p>精确 count(distinct) 要维护完整去重集合，大基数时内存大、单 reduce 慢；<code>approx_count_distinct(col, rsd)</code> 用 HyperLogLog 以 O(1) 近似空间估基数，误差可控（如 rsd=0.01 约 1% 误差）。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "short",
          "stage_label": "30 秒回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "1 分钟回答",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>精确：维护集合，内存随基数线性增长，易倾斜</li>\n<li>近似：HyperLogLog 概率结构，空间小、可并行</li>\n<li>参数 rsd：控制相对标准差，越小越准但越慢</li>\n<li>适用：UV 大盘、基数估算等可容忍误差的场景</li>\n<li>不适用：对账、金融等要求精确的场景</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "long",
          "stage_label": "1 分钟回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "追问",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>rsd 参数怎么选？</li>\n<li>什么场景不能用近似去重？</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "followup",
          "stage_label": "追问"
        }
      ],
