      "id": "SQL-0029",
      "type": "technical",
      "question": "JSON 数组字段怎么解析（from_json / explode / transform）",
      "topic": [
        "sql",
        "json",
        "spark"
      ],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "frequency": "medium",
      "source_type": "knowledge",
      "domain": "sql",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "一句话",
          "html": "<p>用 <code>from_json</code> 把 JSON 字符串按 schema 转结构体，<code>explode</code> 展开数组，<code>transform</code> 处理数组内元素，单引号 JSON 先 replace 成双引号。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "pitch",
          "stage_label": "一句话"
        },
        {
          "title": "30 秒回答",
          "html": "<p>字段里塞整个 JSON 时：先定义 schema，<code>from_json(col, schema)</code> 转 struct，再 <code>explode</code> 展开 array，最后 <code>select</code> 提取字段。Hive 不支持 from_json 的场景用 get_json_object + LATERAL VIEW explode；单引号 JSON 先 <code>regexp_replace</code> 成双引号。</p>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "short",
          "stage_label": "30 秒回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "1 分钟回答",
          "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-sql\">SELECT id, name, type\nFROM (\n  SELECT explode(transform(\n    from_json(v5, &#x27;array&lt;struct&lt;id:bigint,name:string,type:array&lt;string&gt;&gt;&gt;&#x27;),\n    x -&gt; x\n  )) AS e\n) t;</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li>from_json：字符串按 schema 解析成 struct/array</li>\n<li>explode：把数组一行拆多行</li>\n<li>transform：数组内元素做变换</li>\n<li>单引号 JSON：先 replace 成双引号再解析</li>\n<li>平台不支持 from_json：用 get_json_object 逐字段取</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "long",
          "stage_label": "1 分钟回答"
        },
        {
          "title": "追问",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>from_json 和 get_json_object 区别？</li>\n</ul>",
          "diagram": null,
          "stage_key": "followup",
          "stage_label": "追问"
        }
      ],
